{
  "name": "MiroMiro: download every image, rebuild a section in Elementor, rebuild a whole page",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t",
      "name": "Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "a",
      "name": "Note a",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## 1. Download every image from a website\nAll images on the page, fetched and zipped into one file. Change the URL in **Extract Images**.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Get a free MiroMiro API key (300 credits a month, no card): https://miromiro.app/api/onboarding\n2. Open any MiroMiro node > Credential > Create new, paste the key.",
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "name": "Extract Images",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-miromiro.miroMiro",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        60
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "miroMiroApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "MiroMiro API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "website",
        "operation": "images",
        "url": "https://www.allbirds.com",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "name": "One item per image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// MiroMiro returns every image URL on the page. Keep the first 40.\nreturn ($input.first().json.images || []).slice(0, 40).map((img, i) => ({ json: { url: img.url || img.src || img }, pairedItem: { item: 0 } }))"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a3",
      "name": "Download image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [
        720,
        60
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a4",
      "name": "Collect files",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Put every downloaded image on one item so they land in one zip.\nconst binary = {}\n$input.all().forEach((item, i) => { if (item.binary?.data) binary['image_' + String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')] = item.binary.data })\nreturn [{ json: { images: Object.keys(binary).length }, binary, pairedItem: { item: 0 } }]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a5",
      "name": "Zip them",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.compression",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1180,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "compress",
        "binaryPropertyName": "={{ Object.keys($binary).join(\",\") }}",
        "outputFormat": "zip",
        "fileName": "={{ String($('Extract Images').first().json.url || 'website').split('/')[2].replace(/^www./, '') }}-images.zip",
        "binaryPropertyOutput": "data"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b",
      "name": "Note b",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## 2. Turn a section into an Elementor template\nImport the .json in WordPress: Templates > Saved Templates > Import.",
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "name": "Extract as Elementor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-miromiro.miroMiro",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        360
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "miroMiroApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "MiroMiro API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "website",
        "operation": "code",
        "url": "https://stripe.com",
        "framework": "elementor",
        "section": "hero",
        "codeOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "name": "Save as .json",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toText",
        "sourceProperty": "code",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "={{ String($json.url || 'website').split('/')[2].replace(/^www./, '') }}-elementor.json"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c",
      "name": "Note c",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## 3. Rebuild a whole page as code\nEvery section of the page, rebuilt in a real browser and assembled. Open pagePreviewUrl to see it.",
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "name": "Read the page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-miromiro.miroMiro",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        640
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "miroMiroApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "MiroMiro API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "website",
        "operation": "code",
        "url": "https://linear.app",
        "framework": "tailwind",
        "section": "hero",
        "codeOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "name": "List the sections",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// The first result lists every other section on the page, with a ready selector.\nconst first = $input.first().json\nreturn (first.sections || []).filter(s => s.selector !== first.selector)\n  .sort((a, b) => a.order - b.order).slice(0, 12)\n  .map(s => ({ json: { url: first.url || 'https://linear.app', selector: s.selector, section: s.label }, pairedItem: { item: 0 } }))"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "name": "Rebuild each section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-miromiro.miroMiro",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        640
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "miroMiroApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "MiroMiro API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "website",
        "operation": "code",
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "framework": "tailwind",
        "section": "hero",
        "codeOptions": {
          "selector": "={{ $json.selector }}"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "name": "Whole page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Each section files itself under the page; the newest link has them all.\nconst all = [...$('Read the page').all(), ...$input.all()].map(i => i.json)\nconst page = all.filter(r => r.pagePreviewUrl).pop()?.pagePreviewUrl\nreturn [{ json: { pagePreviewUrl: page, sections: all.filter(r => r.code).length }, pairedItem: { item: 0 } }]"
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Run": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extract Images",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Extract as Elementor",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Read the page",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Extract Images": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "One item per image",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "One item per image": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download image",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download image": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Collect files",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Collect files": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Zip them",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Extract as Elementor": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save as .json",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read the page": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "List the sections",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "List the sections": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Rebuild each section",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Rebuild each section": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Whole page",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}